H:In Blodau'r Grug (vol. 3), the music for the set dance The Cambro Britons is three tunes printed one after another: this one, then Cambro Brython 2 and Cambro Brython 3. Only the third is in Alawon Cymru, where it's known simply as Cambro Brython.
